          "quote": "There is no solution under this assumption, in that there is no limit in the downward movement.",
          "said": "Joseph Bertrand",
          "context": "His 1883 review of Cournot's Researches in the Journal des Savants, arguing that price rivalry would drive the duopoly price endlessly down (translated from the French)."
